text_output=And the whole goal—you hear a lot of folks talk about the open edge software stack and other pieces—is packaging now, sample apps, you know, making it more of a full turnkey solution and making that a reference to help scale across all these designs. Where before it was a lot of individual enabling on edge. If we want to really grow that business, it wouldn't be sustainable.
